title: Coalition Affairs
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; coalition_affairs_timer = 5
view-if: CHP_in_government = 1 and not in_CHP_majority and chp_seats < majority_threshold and coalition_dissent >= 5 and coalition_affairs_timer = 0
card-image: img/kabine.jpg
#subtitle: There is dissent within our coalition.

= Coalition Affairs

Our coalition is in trouble. Members of our right-wing coalition partner are constantly criticizing our progressive reforms and are threatening a no-confidence vote to bring down this coalition.

How do we reduce tensions with the coalition?

[+ {! return typeof AnatolianCoalitions!=="undefined"?AnatolianCoalitions.summary(Q):""; !} +]

- @promise_cuts: Agree to the bourgeois plans to cut welfare.
- @resources: Use our party resources to support our allies.
- @bring_down: Instead, we will bring down the government with a no-confidence vote, and call for new elections.
- @bring_down2: Instead, we will bring down the government with a no-confidence vote, and call for new elections.
- @no_change: Take none of these actions.
- @easy_discard


@promise_cuts
on-arrival: workers_chp -= 5; workers_TIP += 5; welfare -= 1; budget += 1; {! Q.coalition_dissent=Math.max(0,(Q.coalition_dissent||0)-10); !}

Fine. By cutting welfare, we have reduced dissent within the coalition.

@resources
subtitle: -2 resources
view-if: historical_mode = 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources (need 2).
choose-if: resources >= 2
on-arrival: resources -= 2; coalition_dissent -= 5; democracystatus -= 2

By transferring campaign funds to our coalition partners, we can make our policies more acceptable to them. Some would call this corruption and a setback for democracy, but perhaps it is necessary.

@no_change

No. We will not do this.

@bring_down
title: The Coalition Government Resigns
view-if: AP_votes <= 35 and AP_votes < chp_votes
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.resetCabinet(Q); if(typeof AnatolianCoalitions!=="undefined")AnatolianCoalitions.start(Q); !}
go-to: coalition_negotiations

= The Coalition Government Resigns

Placeholder

@bring_down2
title: A New Government-Formation Mandate
view-if: AP_votes > 35 and AP_votes > chp_votes
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.resetCabinet(Q); if(typeof AnatolianCoalitions!=="undefined")AnatolianCoalitions.start(Q); !}
go-to: coalition_negotiations

